{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 32, :comments ["<b>And he opened</b> — Two times: here and the other: \"and he opened upon the tablets their handles\" (Exodus). In the building of the Tabernacle: just as there it is language of depiction, so too here — Abraham's camels were depicted, marked, and recognizable to all as his, for camels were not grazed in other fields."], :book :genesis, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 24, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Kitzur Baal HaTurim" "http://sefaria.org"] ["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:16:48.083557170Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}